 - ESCAPE to Nature GALLERY", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the first taste of amazing virtual word - Victoria VR.\n\nVisit our virtual gallery to discover the exciting journey of Czech reapetedly rewarded photographs and cameramans Libor Spacek and Petra Dolezalova from Escape to Nature.\n\nIt was possible to discover distant worlds in documentaries produced by Escape to Nature. \nHere, you get a unique opportunity to have a look on projects aimed at saving the nature especially the underwater world thanks to work done by the team of filmmakers, photographers and scientists from around the world.\n\n", "short_description": "This is the first touch of amazing virtual word - Victoria VR.\n\nVisit our virtual gallery to discover the exciting journey of Escape to Nature.\n\nIt was possible to discover distant worlds in documentaries produced by Escape to Nature. \nHere, you get a unique opportunity to have a look on projects aimed at saving the nature especially the underwater world thanks to work done by the team of filmmakers, photographers and scientists from around the world."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.victoriavr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.victoriavr.com/terms", "publisher_name": "Victoria VR, a.s.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://victoriavr.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PUZZLE", "TRAVEL", "ART_CREATIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"